PostgreSQL Database: Fully relational schema with strict Foreign Keys and cascading deletes.

Row Level Security (RLS): Enabled. Public can only read is_active = true and copyright_status = 'approved' videos. Users can only read their own purchases.

Storage Buckets: 5 public buckets (videos, thumbnails, avatars, banners, audio). URL generation is handled automatically by Supabase.

